<title>SRI LANKA: Tokyo Cement 12-month net up 128 pct.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Cement 12-month net up 128 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Tokyo Cement (Lanka) Ltd, for the 12 months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	 1,495.37    vs    1,163.77</p>
<p>    Ne profit	  114.59    vs	 50.28</p>
<p>    Tax provision     50.81    vs	 66.50</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
